# INTEGRA O/S - .dockerignore
# Docker does NOT read .gitignore. Without this file, `COPY . .` ships the whole
# directory (measured ~28 GB, dominated by The_Hoard) and bakes .env secrets into the image.

# --- Secrets (never bake into an image) ---
.env
.env.*
*.env
*.pem
*.key

# --- Persistent state: mount as volumes at runtime, do not bake ---
The_Hoard/
The Hoard/
local_dbs/
chroma_storage/
kernel_memory/
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

# --- Large non-runtime assets ---
Audio_Lectures/
Reference_PDFs/
Tradingimages/
NewCurriculum2026/
LOGO/

# --- VCS / environments / caches (Windows .venv is also useless in a Linux image) ---
.git
.gitignore
.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.vscode/
.idea/
htmlcov/
.coverage
.apache_beam/
rust/target/

# --- Dev-only ---
scratch/
tests/
AntiGravityconversionprocess/
Dockerdocs.md
*.md
!README.md
